# Pairs with PerToolMinimum. The configurator admits every tool of a granted
# group, so a bare Read grant is offered the mutating data tools.
MODULE: MinimumDropped
TARGET: PerToolMinimum
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the per-tool operation minimum is not applied inside an admitted group
PERTURBS: OpenSession

--- FIND
ToolGroup(t) \in groups /\ ops \cap Required(t) # {} /\ Gate(TRUE, policy, t)}
--- REPLACE
ToolGroup(t) \in groups /\ Gate(TRUE, policy, t)}
--- END
